# Derived by hand from Semantics R3 (`!Updated $a` fires in the tick of each write of `$a`) and pick RE (a row hears its block's writes through the parent): each inc fires the generation's `!Updated $a` in its tick.
test the_generation_hears_its_block

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="inc")
    1: Ui.Button(label="next")
    2/#0/0: Ui.Label(text="page 1: 0")

tick 1
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    2/#0/0: Ui.Label(text="page 1: 1")

tick 2
  in:
    0: click
  changed:
    2/#0/0: Ui.Label(text="page 1: 2")
